Neon containers port (M1), part 7 of 7: spaces interface.

The one seam Neon spaces use to talk to containers:
chrome/browser/neon/containers_api.h. It maps onto the Brave port, so that if
Helium imports Brave containers, only containers_api.cc changes. Neon code,
GPL-3.0.

IsAvailable() is false for off-the-record profiles (the port's service runs
there, Neon does not offer it), and OpenTabInContainer() requires a container
that exists and a lowercase id.

SetNewTabContainerProvider() lets spaces pick the container of new tabs that
have no source page.

